# FOUNTAIN RIM (Tour level 6): UN Plaza's sunken fountain has a granite rim round three sides (the
# fourth is the steps down). From the plaza on the Market side, an ollie onto the rim and a 50-50 along
# it toward Market; popped off: BS 50-50 + FOUNTAIN RIM, 1,936.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 2 teleport 405.85 427.13 -2.02 27.4
cmd 4 set skater.vel.x 2.2641
cmd 4 set skater.vel.y 4.3680
hold ollie 28..43
tap grind 45..85 every 6
bot balance
hold ollie 330..360
run 900
expect event grindStart{line=ledge_401_427_b} within 79..81
expect event gap{id=fountain_rim,gap=FOUNTAIN RIM,points=400} within 360..362
expect no event bail
